{"id":53184,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=53184"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:43:07","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:43:07","slug":"mare-alta-sunset-trail-mansores","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/mare-alta-sunset-trail-mansores\/","title":{"rendered":"Mar\u00e9 Alta Sunset Trail de Mansores 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mar\u00e9 Alta Sunset Trail de Mansores 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Mar\u00e9 Alta Sunset Trail de Mansores 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>29 de agosto de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), na freguesia de <strong>Mansores<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Arouca<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>Confraria Trotamontes<\/strong> em estreita parceria com a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Mansores<\/strong>, a prova celebra o encanto do trail running ao entardecer, percorrendo caminhos hist\u00f3ricos reabertos ap\u00f3s d\u00e9cadas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida na <strong>Escola Prim\u00e1ria de Mansores<\/strong> a partir das <strong>18:00<\/strong>, o percurso leva os atletas por linhas de \u00e1gua cristalinas, densa vegeta\u00e7\u00e3o aut\u00f3ctone e mais de 10 emblem\u00e1ticos Moinhos da Barrosa. O evento integra o <strong>Trail Sprint de 18 km (650m D+)<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong>, culminando num animado arraial tradicional com petiscos e m\u00fasica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Agosto de 2026 \u00e0s 18:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: